<title>UK: GEC up as talk of tie-up with BAe continues.</title>
<headline>GEC up as talk of tie-up with BAe continues.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in General Electric Co Plc rose on Monday as a weekend press report said recent management changes could pave the way for a long-speculated merger with British Aerospace Plc (BAe), dealers said.</p>
<p>Against the trend of a sharply falling FTSE 100 index, down 39.5 points at 4,554.4 by 1114 GMT, GEC was up 4-1/2p at 343. The stock on Friday fell to near its year's low of 327p set on June 5.</p>
</text>
